{"id":"dash-grew-and-grew","title":"Dash Grew and Grew","level":5,"series":"Dash Adventures","cover":{"h":"55d019c7502e513abd4a315fcff00e13","t":"image/webp"},"titleAudio":null,"cast":[{"role":"hero","name":"Logan","portrait":{"h":"cf541143e9c73f6a4921ebd5175623cb","t":"image/webp"}},{"role":"sister","name":"Anastasia","portrait":{"h":"4b8a1a7bc845473e95a93b7d3c7d3a7d","t":"image/webp"}},{"role":"dad","name":"Dad","portrait":{"h":"4a3effd5da379d9c095d2ece4f986c49","t":"image/webp"}},{"role":"mum","name":"Mum","portrait":{"h":"4e8d5c2035e2129d567a2a2bbf62e944","t":"image/webp"}},{"role":"dash","name":"Dash","portrait":{"h":"5394e0f1443cd76f83368aaf141c3340","t":"image/webp"}}],"mystery":null,"practise":["new","grew","blew","whoosh","chimney","toes","phew","August"],"common":["one","people","what","they","little","again","house"],"challenge":["tickle","leaves"],"before":"What do plants need to grow? What would happen if a dinosaur drank plant food?","after":["What made Dash grow?","How did Logan find out how to shrink Dash?","What happened to Dad's plants?","What would you do if you were as big as a house?"],"retell":[2,4,5,10,12,15],"pages":[{"text":"It is a hot day in August. Dad has a new jar of plant food.","bubble":null,"image":{"h":"3e723232340d896f68a71f6a7d48fbea","t":"image/webp"},"alt":"A hot sunny garden (a cosy British terraced house with a small back garden, a lawn and a wooden shed).","audio":{"text":null,"bubble":null}},{"text":"One drop, and his plants grew and grew!","bubble":null,"image":{"h":"56bdd0e64eb52be3f238edf1fc584209","t":"image/webp"},"alt":"Dad squeezes one drop from a dropper into a pot and the plant shoots up into a huge leafy plant, blowing his hair back.","audio":{"text":null,"bubble":null}},{"text":"Then Dash spots the jar. Slurp!","bubble":null,"image":{"h":"c7c40e3f63eb9fb502c33073b8023b7f","t":"image/webp"},"alt":"Dash tips up the jar of plant food and drinks from it, green drips on his chin.","audio":{"text":null,"bubble":null}},{"text":"Dash grew... and grew... and GREW!","bubble":null,"image":{"h":"c974fbbd192f5250346d6dfbd0d381db","t":"image/webp"},"alt":"Dash grows bigger in the garden with motion lines, now as tall as the shed, looking surprised at his own size.","audio":{"text":null,"bubble":null}},{"text":"Now he is as big as the house, next to the chimney!","bubble":null,"image":{"h":"d9e945bae34c2c98adf3854475c9bfaa","t":"image/webp"},"alt":"Giant Dash stands in the back garden, his head above the roof of a cosy British terraced house with a small back garden, a lawn and a wooden shed next to the ch","audio":{"text":null,"bubble":null}},{"text":"Whoosh! He blew the leaves off the trees.","bubble":null,"image":{"h":"07beacc1c4163eb9f179970dc81e92bd","t":"image/webp"},"alt":"Giant Dash blows a big puff of air and leaves swirl off the trees down the street.","audio":{"text":null,"bubble":null}},{"text":"He is as big as ten buses!","bubble":null,"image":{"h":"83b7cca92069b32d1e221538f6a3b75c","t":"image/webp"},"alt":"Giant Dash sits in the street; a red double-decker bus parked next to him looks like a toy.","audio":{"text":null,"bubble":null}},{"text":"People come out to look.","bubble":null,"image":{"h":"05f77b7c37a5cfad1f952a75d24e615d","t":"image/webp"},"alt":"Neighbours in dressing gowns and slippers stand on the pavement pointing up at giant Dash.","audio":{"text":null,"bubble":null}},{"text":"What can they do?","bubble":{"who":"sister","name":"Anastasia","text":"How can we get Dash small again?","side":"left"},"image":{"h":"6559e70f36a2c55e98a61bf7ae309878","t":"image/webp"},"alt":"The family huddles in the garden looking up at giant Dash, who looks a bit worried too.","audio":{"text":null,"bubble":null}},{"text":"Logan reads the back of the jar.","bubble":null,"image":{"h":"61308cd90e32e270d137481d4b0085b8","t":"image/webp"},"alt":"Logan holds the jar and reads the label on the back, one finger under the words.","audio":{"text":null,"bubble":null}},{"text":"\"Tickle his toes!\" Logan shouts.","bubble":null,"image":{"h":"e57c332e31de53eff377e4f117391657","t":"image/webp"},"alt":"Logan shouts with excitement, pointing at giant Dash's huge feet.","audio":{"text":null,"bubble":null}},{"text":"Mum, Dad, Logan and Anastasia tickle Dash's big toes.","bubble":null,"image":{"h":"8631b03a11ba5d32353f04cc18fb64c9","t":"image/webp"},"alt":"The whole family tickles giant Dash's toes with feathers and fingers.","audio":{"text":null,"bubble":null}},{"text":"Hee, hee, hee! Dash shrinks... and shrinks... and shrinks!","bubble":null,"image":{"h":"41b43b36d6d0ba6615343e15dd03263e","t":"image/webp"},"alt":"Dash shrinks back down in stages, laughing all the way.","audio":{"text":null,"bubble":null}},{"text":"Phew! Dash is little again.","bubble":null,"image":{"h":"e9720d921dc5a874d29feafddccaaff2","t":"image/webp"},"alt":"Tiny Dash sits in Anastasia's cupped hands; everyone looks relieved.","audio":{"text":null,"bubble":null}},{"text":"But Dad's plants are as big as the house now!","bubble":null,"image":{"h":"645c155cfe0084fe3d62ccf183b24987","t":"image/webp"},"alt":"The plants in the garden have grown into giant sunflowers and beanstalks towering over a cosy British terraced house with a small back garden, a lawn and a wood","audio":{"text":null,"bubble":null}}],"words":{}}